Mom's Chest is a unique chest appearing in {{s|Home}}. On the first encounter, it always contains {{i|Red Key}} but in later runs will draw additionally from a pool of {{E|Mom}}-related items. Items that draw from the current room's item pool such as {{i|Mystery Gift}} will spawn items from this pool when used in Mom's bedroom.

